# Empirical Input Acquisition and Baseline Reconstruction evidence.
# Provenance manifests, audit summaries, and reconstruction diagnostics are the
# evidence for that milestone's acceptance gates and contain no restricted data.
# The two large month-by-month difference tables stay out of version control and
# are regenerated by their scripts.
